; 31 vertices. Three-masted with main, fore, and triangular mizzen lateen sails.
;
; AXIS CONVERSION: JS (+Z forward, left-handed) → Godot (-Z forward,
; right-handed). Every JS vertex (x, y, z) becomes (x, y, -z). JS `mastZ`
; in sailDeformations is likewise negated to `mast_z`.

